msgstr "Antes de enviar pelo perfil do cluster, inspecione seus recursos::"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "This reads the cluster configuration and reports resource problems; it does not request an allocation. Use ``spacr-remote watch JOB_ID --follow`` to stream new log output while watching; ``--logs`` prints the log tail when watching finishes."
